### A. Basic prompt
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Explain Spring AI in simple terms for a student learning Spring Boot."
}

### B. Structured output
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/study-plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Mia",
  "topic": "RAG in Spring AI",
  "problem": "I understand prompts but I do not understand how RAG works.",
  "goal": "Be ready for the Week 10 lab."
}

### C. Context stuffing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/context-help
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the difference between stuffing the prompt and RAG?"
}

### D. RAG
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/rag-help
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Why is RAG different from basic prompting?"
}
